hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1837","Hushaym narrated to us, Yahya ibn Abi Ishaq informed us, from Sulayman ibn Yasar, from Ubayd Allah ibn al-Abbas who said: Al-Ghumaysa or al-Rumaysa came to the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) complaining of her husband and claiming that he does not approach her. It was only a short while until her husband came and claimed that she is lying, but she wants to return to her first husband. So the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: That is not for you until another man tastes your small honey."
